OL,3,APrince William, Kane and Shearer in
OL,4,Acampaign to use sport to prevent
OL,5,Asuicide
OL,6,
OL,7,F"People who may never seek support
OL,8,Fthemselves and may be struggling in
OL,9,Fsilence," the prince will say later.
OL,11,FThe On Your Side project wants to give
OL,12,Fpeople confidence to start the
OL,13,F"difficult conversations" with friends,
OL,14,Frelations, teammates or colleagues who
OL,15,Fmight be struggling with their mental
OL,16,Fhealth.
